  "completionRules": [
    "Make a dated copy of this template; do not edit the template file.",
    "Freeze the plan id, record ref, sha256, time, both frame ids, exact slot-to-point-pair-to-target assignments, relevant observation identities, transform method, weighting policy and outlier policy before fitting begins.",
    "Require every completed fit and blind point-pair row to reproduce its preFitFrozenPlan assignment exactly; do not add, remove or swap targets, point pairs or observation identities after fitting begins.",
    "Complete independence provenance and exclude every same-lineage candidate before fitting begins.",
    "Complete all eight fit-control point pairs and all six blind-check point pairs; add further controls only in the matching additional array.",
    "For every point pair, bind explicit source and independent-survey frame ids, both coordinate triples, both observation record refs and sha256 values, and one deterministic point-pair evidence ref and sha256.",
    "Record instrument identity and calibration state in surveySession.instrumentRecords and reference it from every point pair.",
    "Seal the blind independent-survey observations before fitting and keep them outside the fit until the fit result identity and freeze time are recorded.",
    "Do not use blind-check coordinates to estimate, tune or refit the transform.",
    "Preserve field-book, observation-bundle, per-observation, point-pair and target-photo byte identities."
  ],
